# Local data / downloaded model weights.
#
# **Anchored with a leading slash, and that is load-bearing.** An unanchored
# `models/` matches at *any* depth, so it silently swallowed the entire
# `src/rag/adapters/models/` package — the HTTP client for the model service
# would have been absent from the repository while working perfectly on the
# machine that wrote it. Anything named `models/` is a plausible package name;
# only the repo-root one is downloaded weights.
/data/
/models/
*.log

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
junit.xml

# Default blob-store root for local development (RAG_INGESTION__BLOB_ROOT).
var/
